  Configure Status Line
  Select which items to display in the status line.

  Type to search
  >
› [ ] Use theme colors       Apply colors from the active /theme
  ───────────────────────
  [x] Primary usage limit    Primary usage remaining; hidden when unavailable
  [x] Secondary usage limit  Secondary usage remaining; hidden when unavailable
  [ ] Model                  Current model name
  [ ] Model + reasoning      Current model name with reasoning level
  [ ] Reasoning              Current reasoning level
  [ ] Current directory      Current working directory

  Monthly 65% left · Weekly 50% left
  Press space to toggle; ←/→ to move; enter to confirm and close; esc to close
